{"parse":{"title":"malinconia","pageid":72852,"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"it\" dir=\"ltr\"><meta property=\"mw:PageProp/toc\" />\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Italiano\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Flag_of_Italy.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"bandiera italiana\"><img alt=\"bandiera italiana\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/03/Flag_of_Italy.svg/40px-Flag_of_Italy.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"27\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/03/Flag_of_Italy.svg/120px-Flag_of_Italy.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1500\" data-file-height=\"1000\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Appendice:Italiano\" title=\"Appendice:Italiano\">Italiano</a></h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=malinconia&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Modifica la sezione Italiano\"><span>modifica</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Sostantivo\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Open_book_01.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f3/Open_book_01.svg/40px-Open_book_01.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f3/Open_book_01.svg/60px-Open_book_01.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"360\" /></a></span><i><a href=\"/wiki/sostantivo\" title=\"sostantivo\">Sostantivo</a></i></h3></div> \n<p><b>malinconia</b><small>&#160;(<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Wikipedia-logo-v2.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Wikipedia\"><img alt=\"Wikipedia\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/80/Wikipedia-logo-v2.svg/20px-Wikipedia-logo-v2.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"18\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/80/Wikipedia-logo-v2.svg/40px-Wikipedia-logo-v2.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"103\" data-file-height=\"94\" /></a></span> <b><a href=\"https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/malinconia\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:malinconia\">approfondimento</a></b>)</small> <i>f sing</i> (<i>pl.</i>: <a href=\"/w/index.php?title=malinconie&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"malinconie (la pagina non esiste)\">malinconie</a>)\n</p>\n<ol><li><small>(<i><a href=\"/wiki/psicologia\" title=\"psicologia\">psicologia</a></i>)</small> <small>(<i><a href=\"/wiki/medicina\" title=\"medicina\">medicina</a></i>)</small> <small>(<i><a href=\"/wiki/psichiatria\" title=\"psichiatria\">psichiatria</a></i>)</small> <small>(<i><a href=\"/wiki/psicanalisi\" title=\"psicanalisi\">psicanalisi</a></i>)</small> <a href=\"/wiki/stato\" title=\"stato\">stato</a> di <a href=\"/wiki/costante\" title=\"costante\">costante</a> <a href=\"/wiki/malumore\" title=\"malumore\">malumore</a></li>\n<li><small>(<i>per estensione</i>)</small> <a href=\"/wiki/momento\" title=\"momento\">momento</a> <a href=\"/wiki/vissuto\" title=\"vissuto\">vissuto</a> con <a href=\"/wiki/profonda\" title=\"profonda\">profonda</a> <a href=\"/wiki/compassione\" title=\"compassione\">compassione</a> per sé e/o per altri, spesso con <a href=\"/wiki/pianto\" title=\"pianto\">pianto</a>, soprattutto con <a href=\"/wiki/riflessione\" title=\"riflessione\">riflessione</a> su <a href=\"/wiki/episodi\" title=\"episodi\">episodi</a> o <a href=\"/wiki/eventi\" title=\"eventi\">eventi</a> già <a href=\"/wiki/trascorsi\" title=\"trascorsi\">trascorsi</a></li></ol>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Sillabazione\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Hyph_abc.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7f/Hyph_abc.svg/60px-Hyph_abc.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"45\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7f/Hyph_abc.svg/120px-Hyph_abc.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"512\" data-file-height=\"260\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/sillabazione\" title=\"sillabazione\">Sillabazione</a></h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Template:-sill-&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Modifica la sezione Sillabazione\"><span>modifica</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<dl><dt>ma | lin | co | nì | a</dt></dl>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Pronuncia\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Nuvola_apps_edu_languages.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/23/Nuvola_apps_edu_languages.svg/40px-Nuvola_apps_edu_languages.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/23/Nuvola_apps_edu_languages.svg/60px-Nuvola_apps_edu_languages.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/pronuncia\" title=\"pronuncia\">Pronuncia</a></h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Template:-pron-&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Modifica la sezione Pronuncia\"><span>modifica</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Aiuto:IPA\" title=\"Aiuto:IPA\">AFI</a>: <span class=\"IPA\" style=\"font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;, &#39;Calibri&#39;, &#39;DejaVu Sans&#39;, &#39;Charis SIL&#39;, &#39;Doulos SIL&#39;, &#39;Gentium Plus&#39;, Gentium, GentiumAlt, &#39;Lucida Grande&#39;, &#39;Arial Unicode MS&#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 110%;\">/maliŋkoˈnia/</span>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Etimologia_/_Derivazione\"><span id=\"Etimologia_.2F_Derivazione\"></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Nuvola_kdict_glass.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/18/Nuvola_kdict_glass.svg/40px-Nuvola_kdict_glass.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/18/Nuvola_kdict_glass.svg/60px-Nuvola_kdict_glass.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/etimologia\" title=\"etimologia\">Etimologia</a> / <a href=\"/wiki/derivazione\" title=\"derivazione\">Derivazione</a></h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Template:-etim-&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Modifica la sezione Etimologia / Derivazione\"><span>modifica</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>dal <a href=\"/wiki/latino\" title=\"latino\">latino</a> tardo <i><a href=\"/wiki/melancholia\" title=\"melancholia\">melancholia</a></i> che deriva a sua volta dal <a href=\"/wiki/greco\" title=\"greco\">greco</a> <a href=\"/wiki/antico\" title=\"antico\">antico</a> <i><a href=\"/wiki/%CE%BC%CE%B5%CE%BB%CE%B1%CE%B3%CF%87%CE%BF%CE%BB%CE%AF%CE%B1\" title=\"μελαγχολία\">μελαγχολία</a></i>, composto da <i><a href=\"/wiki/%CE%BC%CE%AD%CE%BB%CE%B1%CF%82\" title=\"μέλας\">μέλας</a></i> ossia \"<a href=\"/wiki/nero\" title=\"nero\">nero</a>\" e <i><a href=\"/wiki/%CF%87%CE%BF%CE%BB%CE%AE\" title=\"χολή\">χολή</a></i> cioè \"<a href=\"/wiki/bile\" title=\"bile\">bile</a>\"; significa  quindi \"bile nera\"\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"width:auto; background:none; margin-bottom:.5em; font-size:95%; color:#606060; text-align:left\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding:0 1.2em; vertical-align:top\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Wikiquote-logo.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Collabora a Wikiquote\"><img alt=\"Collabora a Wikiquote\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fa/Wikiquote-logo.svg/20px-Wikiquote-logo.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"18\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fa/Wikiquote-logo.svg/40px-Wikiquote-logo.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"355\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"padding:0 1.2em 0 0\"><div style=\"font-style:normal\">«La malinconia è la gioia di essere tristi\n»</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:0 1.2em\">\n</td>\n<td style=\"padding:0 1.2em 0 0\"><div style=\"font-style:normal\">(<small><a href=\"https://it.wikiquote.org/wiki/Victor_Hugo\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"q:Victor Hugo\">Victor Hugo</a></small>)</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Sinonimi\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Icona_sinonimi.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/59/Icona_sinonimi.png/40px-Icona_sinonimi.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/59/Icona_sinonimi.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x\" data-file-width=\"120\" data-file-height=\"120\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/sinonimi\" title=\"sinonimi\">Sinonimi</a></h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Template:-sin-&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Modifica la sezione Sinonimi\"><span>modifica</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/abbattimento\" title=\"abbattimento\">abbattimento</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/avvilimento\" title=\"avvilimento\">avvilimento</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/depressione\" title=\"depressione\">depressione</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/mestizia\" title=\"mestizia\">mestizia</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/scoraggiamento\" title=\"scoraggiamento\">scoraggiamento</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/scoramento\" title=\"scoramento\">scoramento</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/spleen\" title=\"spleen\">spleen</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/tristezza\" title=\"tristezza\">tristezza</a>,</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/inquietudine\" title=\"inquietudine\">inquietudine</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/malumore\" title=\"malumore\">malumore</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/tedio\" title=\"tedio\">tedio</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/uggia\" title=\"uggia\">uggia</a></li>\n<li><small>(<i><a href=\"/wiki/psichiatria\" title=\"psichiatria\">psichiatria</a></i>)</small>  <a href=\"/wiki/ipocondria\" title=\"ipocondria\">ipocondria</a>   <a href=\"/wiki/pessimismo\" title=\"pessimismo\">pessimismo</a>,</li>\n<li>(nella medicina antica)  <a href=\"/wiki/atrabile\" title=\"atrabile\">atrabile</a>, umor nero</li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Contrari\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Fairytale_right_blue.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/67/Fairytale_right_blue.png/20px-Fairytale_right_blue.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/67/Fairytale_right_blue.png/40px-Fairytale_right_blue.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Fairytale_left_blue.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/44/Fairytale_left_blue.png/20px-Fairytale_left_blue.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/44/Fairytale_left_blue.png/40px-Fairytale_left_blue.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/contrario\" title=\"contrario\">Contrari</a></h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Template:-ant-&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Modifica la sezione Contrari\"><span>modifica</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/allegria\" title=\"allegria\">allegria</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/buonumore\" title=\"buonumore\">buonumore</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/entusiasmo\" title=\"entusiasmo\">entusiasmo</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/euforia\" title=\"euforia\">euforia</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/gaiezza\" title=\"gaiezza\">gaiezza</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/gioia\" title=\"gioia\">gioia</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Parole_derivate\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Nuvola_apps_tree.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3b/Nuvola_apps_tree.svg/40px-Nuvola_apps_tree.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3b/Nuvola_apps_tree.svg/60px-Nuvola_apps_tree.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></a></span>  <a href=\"/wiki/parole\" title=\"parole\">Parole</a> <a href=\"/wiki/derivate\" title=\"derivate\">derivate</a></h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Template:-der-&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Modifica la sezione Parole derivate\"><span>modifica</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/malinconicamente\" title=\"malinconicamente\">malinconicamente</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/malinconico\" title=\"malinconico\">malinconico</a>, <a href=\"/w/index.php?title=malinconosiamente&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"malinconosiamente (la pagina non esiste)\">malinconosiamente</a>, <a href=\"/w/index.php?title=malinconioso&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"malinconioso (la pagina non esiste)\">malinconioso</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Varianti\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Gnome-go-down.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6e/Gnome-go-down.svg/20px-Gnome-go-down.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6e/Gnome-go-down.svg/40px-Gnome-go-down.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"48\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Gnome-go-up.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/59/Gnome-go-up.svg/20px-Gnome-go-up.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/59/Gnome-go-up.svg/40px-Gnome-go-up.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"48\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/variante\" title=\"variante\">Varianti</a></h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Template:-var-&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Modifica la sezione Varianti\"><span>modifica</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=maninconia&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"maninconia (la pagina non esiste)\">maninconia</a>, <a href=\"/w/index.php?title=melancolia&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"melancolia (la pagina non esiste)\">melancolia</a>, <a href=\"/w/index.php?title=melanconia&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"melanconia (la pagina non esiste)\">melanconia</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Traduzione\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Gnome-globe.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f3/Gnome-globe.svg/40px-Gnome-globe.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f3/Gnome-globe.svg/60px-Gnome-globe.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"48\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/traduzione\" title=\"traduzione\">Traduzione</a></h3></div>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" data-expandtext=\"Mostra\" data-collapsetext=\"Nascondi\" style=\"padding:0.2em 0.6em 0.2em 0.6em; border-right:1px solid #BEBEBE; border-bottom:1px dotted black; background:#EDEDED; color:#000;\">Vedi le traduzioni\n<div class=\"z-index:-1; toccolours mw-collapsible-content\" style=\"border:0;\">\n<table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" class=\"translations\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"beige\" valign=\"top\" width=\"48%\">\n<dl><dd><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/francese\" title=\"francese\">francese</a>: <a href=\"/w/index.php?title=m%C3%A9lancolie&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"mélancolie (la pagina non esiste)\">mélancolie</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/indonesiano\" title=\"indonesiano\">indonesiano</a>: <a href=\"/w/index.php?title=melankolis&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"melankolis (la pagina non esiste)\">melankolis</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/inglese\" title=\"inglese\">inglese</a>: <a href=\"/wiki/melancholy\" title=\"melancholy\">melancholy</a>, low spirits, <a href=\"/wiki/sadness\" title=\"sadness\">sadness</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/tedesco\" title=\"tedesco\">tedesco</a>: <a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Melancholie&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Melancholie (la pagina non